Fonts
-----

Bundled under public/fonts and served from this origin, so like the libraries
above these ARE redistributed by this product. There are no external
font hosts: no Google Fonts, no gstatic, no CDN, and no external stylesheets.
tests/fonts.test.mjs fails if a font host appears anywhere under public/.

Each entry below is verified by reading the licence file that ships with the
family AND the name table inside the binaries, rather than inferring either
from the directory name. Family and version are quoted from the binary.

Every licence file is fingerprinted in tests/fonts.test.mjs, together with the
family name and version of each family's binaries. A font cannot be updated
without failing the build, which is the point: licences are not retroactive, so
the risk is not that a licence changes under us but that a NEWER RELEASE arrives
under different terms and nobody looks.

